      "writtenOn": "2023-06-21T10:50:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, I copied and pasted code that’s been running in production for six years.\n\nIt does close the Conn if the Context is closed before returning.\n\nssh.Dial doesn’t return a net.Conn, Client.Dial does, hence the incremental change.\n\nMany packages expect something that implements DialContext, e.g. net/http.Transport (its Dial field being deprecated).",
      "parentUuid": "2af9e731_e0217553",
      "revId": "13693f58e5b7826ca450d222aa24d764ee5d2782",
